mathop boldsymbol cal frak rm bf it tt bm'''.split())
FUNCTIONS = set('''sin cos tan cot sec csc arcsin arccos arctan sinh cosh
tanh log ln exp det'''.split())
DELIMITERS = set('''left right big Big bigg Bigg bigl bigr Bigl Bigr
