capitalized 'With' strengthens the response. Joined continuations recognize
'within', 'without', 'withhold' and 'wither'. 'With respect to' also responds
on 'to'. Protection and respect words have positive lexical responses away
from these phrases. Smaller responses follow translations of 'with'.
